60:["$","p",null,{"children":["The worker sends a keepalive every half of its ",["$","code",null,{"children":"worker_api_endpoint.timeout"}],"\n(default 5 s, so every 2.5 s), and the scheduler evicts a worker it has not\nheard from for ",["$","code",null,{"children":"worker_timeout_s"}]," (default 10 s), checking once a second. Any\nmessage from the worker resets that clock, not only keepalives. The\nscheduler counts what it receives in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_worker_keepalives_total"}]," and\ndepartures by reason in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge_worker_disconnections_total"}],"."]}]
